"""Small author-written evaluation sets (written for this study, never tuned on).

CHAT_PROMPTS: chat-style prompts with gold PER / LOC marked as [[PER:...]] /
[[LOC:...]]. They deliberately include the hard cases for chat input:
lower-cased names, inflected names (fi, pl), first-name-only mentions, names
that are also common words (Rose, Sole, Luz, Sten, Toivo), honorific +
surname, street names. 8 prompts x 10 languages = 80. Indicative only: small,
written by one person, not representative of real traffic.

NEGATIVES: text containing no person and no location (code, logs, business
chat). Any PER/LOC prediction here is spurious. ORG predictions are counted
separately (product / team / tool names are arguable).
"""

